<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0 70px', fontFamily: "'思源黑体', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, paddingTop: 24 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 40, background: '#3B82F6', borderRadius: 2 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>五层流水线：从"网页"到"告警"</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 540, gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 84, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6 0%, #2563EB 100%)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 26px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 50 }}>1</Text>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>采集层 — 17 个公开渠道，插件化注册</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DBEAFE' }}>代码托管 / Paste 站 / 包仓库 / 容器镜像 / Wiki / App 与小程序包 / 本地内网……新增渠道只需实现 1 个方法</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 84, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #0EA5E9 0%, #0284C7 100%)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 26px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 50 }}>2</Text>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>解析层 — 什么文件都能"读出字来"</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E0F2FE' }}>文本抽取 + 归档解包（zip/tar.gz）+ 镜像层逐层解包 + 小程序包解包 + APK 字符串提取</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 84, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #06B6D4 0%, #0891B2 100%)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 26px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 50 }}>3</Text>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>检测层 — 四层收敛，层层排除假信号</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CFFAFE' }}>规则 / 结构化 / 熵命中 → 占位符过滤 → 可解释概率评分 → 验证凭据是否仍可用</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 84, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #14B8A6 0%, #0D9488 100%)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 26px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 50 }}>4</Text>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>验证层 — 16 个只读"验活器"</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CCFBF1' }}>只调用平台的只读身份接口，确认凭据"是否仍有效"——云签名算法（AWS SigV4 / 阿里云 / 腾讯云）自实现，默认关闭、全局限速</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 84, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #22C55E 0%, #16A34A 100%)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 26px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 50 }}>5</Text>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>输出层 — 从"发现"到"能行动"</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCFCE7' }}>指纹去重 + 凭据对关联 + 归属识别 + 处置建议（可复制代码片段）+ MTTD 时效统计 + 可视化看板</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#94A3B8' }}>技术栈：Python 3.12 + SQLite（可选 PostgreSQL）+ Streamlit 看板，65 个单元测试全部通过</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8' }}>凭迹 CredWatch · 项目解读</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8' }}>03 / 11</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
